  <content>
  <note class="self-check"><para>Which of the following ordered pairs falls within the solution set to the system of inequalities?</para>
<para>\(–5x\;+\;2y\;&gt;\;–5\)</para>
<para>\(4x\;+\;3y\;&lt;\;27\)</para>
 </note>
